            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article reviews the process of migration of nociogenic zones and principles of their integrative switching - off from the point of systematic approach and the informational-structural theory of pain. The phenomenon of migration of nociogenic zones underlies the development of clinical manifestations of pain.</AbstractText>
